# Brief replies

- Default: **1–3 short sentences**, or ≤5 bullets. No task echo. No “next steps” essays unless asked.
- Gates/commands: one line — `OK gates` or `FAIL <name> — fix <one action>`.
- Expand only when the user asks why/how/details, or Plan Mode needs `### Critique`.
- Debug Mode may use longer evidence dumps while investigating.
